  pasannānaṃ bhiyyobhāvāya, saddhammaṭṭhitiyā, vinayānuggahāya. Evañca
  pana bhikkhave imaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:
]

“Sampajānamusāvāde pācittiyan ”ti.

