Evañca pana bhikkhave imaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:

“Yo pana bhikkhu mātugāmassa uttariṃ chappañcavācāhi dhammaṃ deseyya
aññatra viññunā purisaviggahena pācittiyan ”ti.

