  hi nāma chabbaggiyā bhikkhū there bhikkhū anupakhajja seyyaṃ
  kappessantī ”ti? ―pe― “Saccaṃ kira bhikkhave there bhikkhū anupakhajja
  seyyaṃ kappethā ”ti? “Saccaṃ bhagavā ”ti. Vigarahi buddho bhagavā ―pe―
  Evañca pana bhikkhave imaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:
]

“Yo pana bhikkhu saṅghike vihāre jānaṃ pubbūpagataṃ bhikkhuṃ anupakhajja
seyyaṃ kappeyya ‘yassa sambādho bhavissati so pakkamissatī 'ti, etadeva
paccayaṃ karitvā anaññaṃ pācittiyan ”ti.

