- “Bạch Thế Tôn, đúng vậy.”

Pācittiyapāḷi - Bhikkhuvibhaṅgo Bhikkhunovādavaggo - Pāc. 6. 3. 1.

Vigarahi buddho bhagavā: ―pe― “Kathaṃ hi nāma tumhe moghapurisā
bhikkhunīnaṃ parittaññeva dhammiṃ kathaṃ katvā divasaṃ tiracchāna-
