dukkaṭassa. Anatthaṅgate anatthaṅgatasaññī, anāpatti.

Anāpatti uddesaṃ dento, paripucchaṃ dento, ‘osārehi ayyā 'ti vuccamāno
osāreti, pañhaṃ pucchati, pañhaṃ puṭṭho katheti, aññassatthāya bhaṇantaṃ
bhikkhuniyo suṇanti, sikkhamānāya, sāmaṇerāya, ummattakassa,
ādikammikassā ”ti. Atthaṅgatasikkhāpadaṃ dutiyaṃ.

