“Saccaṃ kira tumhe bhikkhave bhikkhunīhi saddhiṃ saṃvidhāya ekaṃ nāvaṃ
abhirūhathā ”ti?

“Saccaṃ bhagavā ”ti.

Vigarahi buddho bhagavā: ―pe― Kathaṃ hi nāma tumhe moghapurisā
bhikkhunīhi saddhiṃ saṃvidhāya ekaṃ nāvaṃ abhirūhissatha? Netaṃ
moghapurisā appasannānaṃ vā pasādāya ―pe― Evañca pana bhikkhave imaṃ
sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:

“Yo pana bhikkhu bhikkhuniyā saddhiṃ saṃvidhāya ekaṃ nāvaṃ abhirūheyya 1
uddhagāminiṃ vā adhogāminiṃ vā pācittiyan ”ti.

Evañcidaṃ bhagavatā bhikkhūnaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ paññattaṃ hoti.

