  jānaṃ bhikkhunīparipācitaṃ piṇḍapātaṃ paribhuñjissasi? Netaṃ
  moghapurisa appasannānaṃ vā pasādāya ―pe― Evañca pana bhikkhave imaṃ
  sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:
]

“Yo pana bhikkhu jānaṃ bhikkhunīparipācitaṃ piṇḍapātaṃ bhuñjeyya
pācittiyan ”ti.

Evañcidaṃ bhagavatā bhikkhūnaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ paññattaṃ hoti.

