pacchimo māso, atthate kaṭhine pañcamāsā ‘cīvaradānasamayo 'ti
bhuñjitabbaṃ. Cīvarakārasamayo nāma cīvare kayiramāne ‘cīvarakāra-
samayo 'ti bhuñjitabbaṃ. Addhānagamanasamayo nāma ‘addhayojanaṃ
gacchissāmī 'ti bhuñjitabbaṃ, gacchantena bhuñjitabbaṃ, gatena4
bhuñjitabbaṃ.

