+ 4. 6. DUTIYAPAVĀRAṆASIKKHĀPADAṂ

+ Tena samayena buddho bhagavā sāvatthiyaṃ viharati jetavane
  anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. Tena kho pana samayena dve bhikkhū kosalesu
