  bhikkhu bhikkhuṃ bhuttāviṃ pavāritaṃ anatirittena bhojanena
  abhihaṭṭhuṃ pavāressatī ”ti? ―pe― “Saccaṃ kira tvaṃ bhikkhu bhikkhuṃ
  bhuttāviṃ pavāritaṃ anatirittena bhojanena abhihaṭṭhuṃ pavāresī ”ti?
  “Saccaṃ bhagavā ”ti. Vigarahi buddho bhagavā: ―pe― Kathaṃ hi nāma tvaṃ
  moghapurisa bhikkhuṃ bhuttāviṃ pavāritaṃ anatirittena bhojanena
  abhihaṭṭhuṃ pavāressasi? Netaṃ moghapurisa appasannānaṃ vā pasādāya
