]

Bhikkhū 'ti ―pe― ayaṃ imasmiṃ atthe adhippeto ‘bhikkhū 'ti.

Bhikkhun 'ti aññaṃ bhikkhu.

Ehāvuso gāmaṃ vā nigamaṃ vā 'ti gāmopi nigamopi nagarampi gāmo ceva
