+ 6. 6. JOTISIKKHĀPADAṂ

+ Tena samayena buddho bhagavā bhaggesu viharati suṃsumāragire 1
  bhesakalāvane migadāye. Tena kho pana samayena bhikkhū hemantike kāle
  aññataraṃ mahantaṃ susirakaṭṭhaṃ jotiṃ samādahitvā visibbesuṃ. Tasmiṃ
