Apaccuddhārake apaccuddhārakasaññī paribhuñjati, āpatti pācittiyassa.
Apaccuddhārake vematiko paribhuñjati, āpatti pācittiyassa.
Apaccuddhārake paccuddhārasaññī paribhuñjati, āpatti pācittiyassa.

Adhiṭṭheti vā visasajjeti vā, āpatti dukkaṭassa. Paccuddhārake
apaccuddhārakasaññī, āpatti dukkaṭassa. Paccuddhārake vematiko, āpatti
