pariyāpuṇanti tesaṃ kukkuccaṃ na hoti vihesā na hoti, vilekhā na hoti.
Anuddiṭṭhaṃ idaṃ varaṃ, anuggahitaṃ idaṃ varaṃ, apariyāpuṇitaṃ 2 idaṃ
varaṃ, adhāritaṃ idaṃ varaṃ, vinayo vā antaradhāyatu, ime vā bhikkhū
