  nāma bhikkhu ratanaṃ uggahessatī ”ti? ―pe― “Saccaṃ kira tvaṃ bhikkhu
  ratanaṃ uggahesī ”ti? “Saccaṃ bhagavā ”ti. Vigarahi buddho bhagavā:
  ―pe― Kathaṃ hi nāma tvaṃ moghapurisa ratanaṃ uggahessasi? Netaṃ
  moghapurisa, appasannānaṃ vā pasādāya ―pe― Evañca pana bhikkhave imaṃ
  sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:
