  bhagavantaṃ dūratova āgacchantaṃ, disvāna bhagavantaṃ etadavoca:
  “Āgacchatu me bhante sayanaṃ passatū ”ti. Atha kho bhagavā tato va
  paṭinivattitvā bhikkhū āmantesi: “Āsayato bhikkhave moghapuriso
  veditabbo ”ti. Atha kho bhagavā āyasmantaṃ upanandaṃ sakyaputtaṃ
  anekapariyāyena vigarahitvā dubharatāya ―pe― Evañca pana bhikkhave
