khādeyya vā bhuñjeyya vā, paṭidesetabbaṃ tena bhikkhunā: ‘Gārayhaṃ āvuso
dhammaṃ āpajjiṃ asappāyaṃ pāṭidesanīyaṃ, taṃ paṭidesemī '”ti.

