  chattapāṇissa dhammaṃ desessantī ”ti? ―pe― “Saccaṃ kira tumhe
  bhikkhave chattapāṇissa dhammaṃ desethā ”ti? “Saccaṃ bhagavā ”ti.
  Vigarahi buddho bhagavā: ―pe― Kathaṃ hi nāma tumhe moghapurisā
  chattapāṇissa dhammaṃ desessatha? Netaṃ moghapurisā appasannānaṃ vā
  pasādāya ―pe― Evañca pana bhikkhave imaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ uddiseyyātha:
]

“Na chattapāṇissa dhammaṃ desessāmī 'ti sikkhā karaṇīyā ”ti.

Evañcidaṃ bhagavatā bhikkhūnaṃ sikkhāpadaṃ paññattaṃ hoti.

